        "base": "https://www.wananga.com/feed/rss2",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div>\n  <h3>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            Caf\u00e9 Assistant \u2013 Ng\u0101 Purapura (Manaaki Tangata)\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n    <span>\n      \n           - CLOSED\n          \n    </span>\n  </h3>\n  <h5>\n    <span>\n      \n           Full time - Fixed term\n          \n    </span>\n  </h5>\n  <h5>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u014ctaki\n          \n    </span>\n  </h5>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            An exciting opportunity has become available for our extended W\u0101nanga community at Cafe\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"https://website.yorb.tech/site/002b888d/ng%C4%81-purapura?preview=true&amp;nee=true&amp;showOriginal=true&amp;dm_checkSync=1&amp;dm_try_mode=true\" target=\"_blank\">\n      \n           Ng\u0101 Purapura\n          \n    </a>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            .\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Ng\u0101 Purapura is seeking a Cafe assistant to join the team. The primary role is to ensure that our manuhiri receive the utmost quality experience and service whilst providing top level support to the Cafe staffing team.\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Applications are now being sought to fulfill this busy, dynamic role.\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           The ideal candidate for this role has:\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Outstanding customer service &amp; sales skills,\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Communicates well in English and has some level of Te Reo M\u0101ori,\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            The ability to work under pressure and maintain composure in a busy working environment,\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            The ability to work well within a team and multi task,\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Experience in the hospitality industry is preferred, however training will be given.\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Applications close, 17\n          \n    </span>\n    <sup>\n      \n           th\n          \n    </sup>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u00a0March, 2025.\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role contact:\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Dionne Seng, Kaihaut\u016b Te Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            E.\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"mailto:Dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\n      \n           Dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\n          \n    </a>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n      </span>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           P. 06 3649011 xtn 757\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n</div>"
      }
